# U's pulse on the lever-on edge pulls the slime row down and pushes the rider R down with it;
# the lever-off pulse pushes the row back up (spit) and drags R back to its place.
design designs/gadgets/slime-rider.txt
probe R_up 0 2 0
probe R_down 0 1 0
probe row 0 3 0
use 3 1 0
expect_trace R_down ...~~rrrrr
expect R_up s
expect row .
use 3 1 0
expect_trace R_down r.........
expect R_up r
expect row s
